      en: ["Established in 1979 in the western Chatkal Valley.", "Protects a massive territory of 112,018 hectares.", "Main protection zone for the endemic Menzbier's marmot.", "Hosts wild ancestors of cultivated tulips and fruit trees.", "Located directly along the isolated border with Uzbekistan.", "Consists of a diverse mix of steppes and broadleaf forests."],
