      en: ["The site hosts a collection of more than 30,000 prehistoric images.", "Engravings span from the 3rd millennium BC to the early Middle Ages.", "The park is situated at elevations ranging from 3,000 to 3,450 meters.", "Saimaluu-Tash has been on the UNESCO Tentative List since 2001.", "The name translates to embroidered stone in the Kyrgyz language.", "Access is strictly limited to July and August due to heavy snow cover."],
